{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/justgetwet/items/594390/", "pk": 594390, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/justgetwet/", "pk": 90304, "shortname": "justgetwet", "name": "Just Get Wet", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "2.5 Day Offshore Spearfishing Charter", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 5, "unicode": "2.5 Day Offshore Spearfishing Charter", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "Sold Out!", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 96.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 24.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 10500, "description": "", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "Thanks for booking your 2.5-day spearfishing trip with us aboard *Escapade*! We’re pumped to have you join us for this offshore adventure.\n\nHere’s everything you need to know before we head out:\n\n---\n\n**🚤 Trip Overview**  \n- **Pickup Location:** Dana Landing, Mission Bay  \n- **Parking:** Please park at the **Freedom Boat Club lot**  \n   - 📍 [Freedom Boat Club – Mission Bay Location](https://www.google.com/maps/place/Freedom+Boat+Club+San+Diego/@32.761884,-117.239007,17z)  \n- We’ll depart in the **evening**, traveling overnight while you sleep.  \n- You’ll spend **three nights aboard Escapade**:  \n   - Night 1: Traveling out  \n   - Night 2: Anchored after the first dive day  \n   - Night 3: Traveling back  \n- You’ll wake up ready to dive both mornings, and we’ll return early morning on the third day.\n\n---\n\n**🧳 What to Bring**  \n- **California fishing license** – required for all spearfishing and fishing  \n- **Your own dive gear**  \n- A **pillowcase** (we provide the pillows)  \n- **Sleeping bag or linens** for your bunk (a sleeping bag usually works best)  \n- **Warm layers** – nights on the water can get chilly, and there’s nothing worse than being cold at sea  \n- **Fishing rods** (optional, but you're welcome to bring them)  \n- **One dive bag + one dry bag** with clothes and personal items is usually perfect  \n- Any **specialty snacks or alcoholic beverages** you’d like to bring (we’ll have food and drinks covered)\n\n---\n\n**🎯 Gear Availability**  \nWe’ll have a selection of **tuna guns with full setups**, as well as **mid-range guns** that are perfect for kelp paddies and island diving—ideal for species like yellowtail, white seabass, and mahi mahi.  \nJust let us know in advance what you’ll need so we can make sure we’ve got it onboard and ready to go.\n\n---\n\nIf you have any **food allergies or dietary restrictions**, please let us know ahead of time so we can plan accordingly.\n\nThe crew will be working hard for you and tips go a long way! Cash, Venmo and Zelle all work great\n\nWe’re looking forward to a killer trip filled with good dives, good people, and good times. If you have any questions before we head out, just shoot us a message.\n\nSee you soon!\n\nBest,  \nChris   \n619-320-8022\ninfo@justgetwet.com\nwww.justgetwet.com\n@justgetwet_\n\n---", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Get to the best hunting grounds in comfort!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/justgetwet/items/